<title>USA: Nitros discontinues unit merger plan.</title>
<headline>Nitros discontinues unit merger plan.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>NITROS Franchise Corp said on Friday it discontinued the planned merger of its QuickLAB Multimedia Centers Inc of Nevada unit with QuickLAB Multimedia Centers Inc of South Florida.</p>
<p>NITROS said in a news release that the decision to abandon the merger was made at a special meeting of its board.</p>
<p>NITROS shares closed up 3/16 to 5/8 in bulletin board trading.</p>
</text>
